description:
World Wars Tanks is a free online tactical tank arcade game dedicated to the major battles of World War II. Kpfw. IV; and the American M4 Sherman, M2, M3 Lee, and others.
Choose one of four main factions:
USSR – durable and widely produced tanks with excellent cross-country ability;
Germany – powerful armor and highly accurate guns;
USA – balanced vehicles with good mobility and reliability.
UK – heavy armor and powerful guns.

instructions:
PC Controls:
Hold the left mouse button and move the mouse to aim;
Release the left mouse button to shoot.

Mobile Controls:
Hold your finger on the screen and move it to aim;
Release your finger from the screen to shoot!

Each level presents a set of words;
Find meaningful connections and group them;
Use logic and knowledge to solve all associations;
Use hints if stuck;
Progress through levels and unlock new themes and challenges.

If you are playing on a computer:
- Click on an item with the mouse;
- Hold down the mouse key and drag the item to the desired location.
If you are playing on a smartphone:
- Tap the item with your finger;
- Hold your finger on the touchscreen and drag the item to the desired location.
There are also 3 boosters available to you:
- Hint (light bulb icon). Sets the item to its correct location;
- Freeze. Freezes the timer for 60 seconds;
- Compass. Will show the location of any 4 items.

description:
Drive a Moscow metro train, transport passengers, explore stations!
Metro lines:
- Kalininskaya (8) (Tretyakovskaya, Marksistskaya, Ploshchad Ilyicha, Aviamotornaya, Shosse Entuziastov, Perovo, Novogireyevo, Novokosino)

Trains:
- "Nomernoy" 81-717/714;
- "Oka" 81-760/761;
- Wagon type "E" 81-703;
- "Moscow" 81-765/766.

Informant: the real records of the informant of the Moscow metro.

Game Modes:
- Driver mode: control the Moscow metro train;
- Training: learn how to drive a train.

instructions:
Train control:
- Speed dial: move the controller on the left to the position "X1", "X2", "X3" or "X4";
- Speed reduction: move the controller on the left to the position "T1", "T2" or "T3";
- Start recording the informant: a button with a speaker on the bottom right;
- Doors: a button with doors on the bottom right (to open the doors, you need to be at the station, no more than 3 meters from the rail);
- Camera - camera button in the upper left corner;

Help Papa Buza bring good things to the house. Just don't drop it! Carry very carefully, move smoothly, without jerking, accelerate and stop carefully. Go around obstacles without catching them! Don't fall into the water. Buzya can't swim.

Control
PC (Mouse)
Hold the left button and move it.
Right - moving forward;
Left - backward movement;
Down - movement to the right, closer to the viewer;
Up - movement to the left, further from the viewer.
Space - jump

Mobile (Joystick)
Move the joystick
Right - moving forward;
Left - backward movement;
Down - movement to the right, closer to the viewer;
Up - movement to the left, further from the viewer.

1. Examine the two images carefully. Find five differences on them, click on the difference (on PC), or press your finger on it (if you play on your phone);
2. If you find it difficult to find the difference, use the hint for advertising;
3. Pass new levels, improve your skills in finding differences!

Clear the level of crates and ghosts using bombs to open the exit.

Use the “freezer” to blow up a frozen ghost and the “shrinker” to jump over a ghost that can corner you.

Destroyed ghosts can respawn as long as there are crates on the level.

Mushrooms also help destroy ghosts. Upgrade them to increase their power!
But be careful of the mummies! They immediately detonate a bomb. So run away to a safe distance!

Collect coins and buy upgrades.

p.s.: Use the radar to detect ghosts that are out of sight. It will be useful once you upgrade it.

Controls:
PC:

W,A,S,D, arrow keys - move;
Mouse - camera rotation;
SPACE - jump;
Q,E, mouse wheel - change item in inventory;
Tab, Shift, F, LMB - use item;
Esc (twice), P - pause;

Mobile:

Joystick - move;
Swipe screen to rotate the camera;
Jump button;
Buttons of items in the inventory;

The camera sensitivity can be changed in the settings.

description:
Travel through different seas, catch fish in a variety of magical places.

In our game, very many unique bodies of water.

Game features:

- more than 100 kinds of fish;
- a lot of unique water bodies;
- cool fishing gear;
- various tasks;
- aquariums where you can grow and sell fish.

instructions:
Controls:
1. Cast/pull the rod - any mouse button (right/left);
2. Move left - "F" key;
3. Move right - "B" key.

description:
Come and help good Santa Claus in his fight against Evil Frost! Join the adventure in a snowy land! 
Christmas Drop - Merge Game is based on 2048 Classical Game. Vivid graphics of Christmas-tree toys and fascinating animations will create New Year festive mood while you enjoy nice gameplay. 
Features: 
- Basic, uncomplicated and unstoppable to play with only single finger tap;
- Use of thoughtful strategies to keep the toys from spilling out of the container;
- Discovering and unlocking of new toys as you progress in the game;
- Experience smoothness: smooth collision effects and the explosion refreshing effects will let you feel the charm of the game throughout the process.
Dive into a fresh and addictive adventure. Get ready for an exciting combination of fun and strategy as you embark on a New Year-themed merge mission!

instructions:
How to play?
- Tap the screen to choose where you want to drop the toy;
- Merge two same toys to get the new bigger one;
- Create as many combos as possible;
- Buffs come in handy whenever you need them: “shuffle” will shake the playing field, “magic wand” will remove the row near gameover line, “hammer” will crush the selected toy, “plus one” will upgrade the toy; 
- Try your best to achieve the biggest toy.

Management:

On mobile devices:

Use the buttons on the phone screen.

On PCs:
- W-A-S-D keys to control the bus;
- Spacebar - handbrake;
- C - change camera view;
- G - horn;
- Q - left turn signal;
- E - right turn signal;
- Esc - pause.

Controls for PC:
WAD - move;
LMB - use tool;

Controls for phones:
Touch buttons on the screen;

description:
"Battle of the red and blue agents" is a game in which you will have to take part in a duel with your opponent. Choose from a variety of locations and weapons to fight not for life, but for death. The game is perfect to brighten up your free time, and spend it fun, while participating in a duel on scissors or sledgehammers, for example. Get a lot of positive emotions from spending time in this game.

Game features:
Is a realistic fight-duel;
Simple but interesting game;
Large variety of locations in the game;
Has a simple and easy gameplay;
Great for your leisure time.

instructions:
Collect stars on the levels to unlock the coolest cars and participate in the leaderboard.

Use the pause menu to enter the garage or the map, as well as to control the sound in racing, derby, ramp jumping and free riding around the city.

PC Management:
W or forward arrow - gas;
A or left arrow - turn left;
S or back arrow - brake / reverse movement;
D or right arrow - turn right;

Management on mobile devices:
Using the control buttons on the screen

description:
Find hidden objects & solve puzzles to open the tricky doors and escape the room.
100 Doors is a challenging brain game. Open rooms by playing Mini-games, Logical Puzzles and Hidden Objects.
The main goal of this hundred doors game challenge is to unlock the door lock. You'll have to open tricky doors and get out of the room.

FEATURES:

- Escape Rooms Challenge. The game will help keep your logical abilities and ingenuity in good shape;
- Room Escape Game including hidden objects, mini-games, challenging games & more;
- Lots of levels. The levels are surprisingly creative, not a single puzzle is repeated;
- Stunning animations. The visuals are simple to look at, which is vital because this is a fun puzzle game that will keep you entertained for hours;
- Logical tasks;
- Adventure game for families. It is a challenging game for kids and adults! To solve riddles yourself or play with friends;
- Bright and attractive graphics;
- Simple and straightforward gameplay

instructions:
Computer: Use the keyboard and mouse to control the cat and interact with the buttons.
Mobile: Use the joystick on the touch screen to move the cat.

- Unlock new seeds by buying chests;
- Unlock new territories by building bridges;
– Plow the land to grow crops;
– Harvest the harvest and sell it!

description:
Do you like puzzles and hidden object games? Do you play games from the 100 Doors series? Then this point-and-click game is just what you need! Use all your skills to complete all levels and get all achievements.

Functions:
- exciting puzzles;
- point-and-click genre;
- cool mechanics: moving in time and space, combining objects, searching for hidden objects, puzzles and much more;
- amazing levels with very beautiful animation;
- many beautiful and detailed locations;

The main goal in the "100 Doors Challenge" is to get out of the room. Using all the capabilities of the device, you need to open each of the 100 doors and move the elevator to the next floor. Find hidden objects, solve puzzles and use objects to do it!

Create the most powerful gym, connect athletes!

A large gym is at your disposal. Your task is to get new athletes, combine similar ones to get more powerful athletes. The most powerful athletes can be taken to a boxing competition. You need to click as often and quickly as possible to defeat your opponent in a difficult battle.

Game Features:
- Colorful graphics;
- Convenient controls;
- Merge and boxing system;
- Lots of characters.

Welcome to the gladiatorial fights of stickmen for cribs!

Take on the role of a commander, control your squad of stickmen, upgrade your soldiers, upgrade your base defense, get resources, fight on the battlefield with other players and capture enemy bases. And the enemy bases are their beds.

The game has many levels. With each level, the base becomes more and more difficult to defend, and opponents become more aggressive and powerful. Will you be able to maintain your position as a Leader and defeat everyone?

Game Features:

- Excellent 3D graphics;
- Epic battles;
- Pumping system;
- Lots of levels.

You are a tracker who saw that your neighbor is planning something sinister!

The game takes place at night. You need to sneak into the house unnoticed, without making noise or attracting attention to yourself. You need to find all the hidden objects and solve the mystery of your neighbor's scary house. What terrible secrets does your neighbor keep?

Game Features:
- Ominous music;
- Convenient controls;
- Fascinating plot;
- Scary atmosphere.

instructions:
PC:
- In order to lower the block into the desired cell, click the left mouse button in this place;
- Try to combine as many numbers as possible, check your result in the leaders, to do this, left-click on the trophy icon.
Smartphone/Tablet:
- In order to lower the block into the desired cell, click on the smartphone/tablet screen in this place;

description:
The goal of the game is to use your logical imagination to collect blocks, placing them on an 8x8 field.

Advantages of the game:
- develops thinking and logic;
- endless level;
- use moves wisely to extend the game timer;
- global rating;
- a break from everyday activities and relaxation during a calm gameplay!

instructions:
The goal of Sudoku is to fill the 9x9 playing field (each row, column and 3x3 block) with numbers from 1 to 9. The basic rules of Sudoku are:
- vertical numbers should not be repeated;
- numbers should not be duplicated horizontally;
- a number can appear in a 3x3 square only once.

For difficult levels, the game has built-in notes that greatly simplify the process of finding candidate numbers in cells.

description:
The goal of the game is not to lose as early as possible and to score as many points as possible. Improve your accuracy thanks to very competent rolling of balls. The more blocks with balls you destroy, the more points you accumulate. Check your results in the world rankings, maybe you are already number 1.

Advantages of the game:
- endless level;
- global rating;
- increasing accuracy, accuracy;
- relaxation after a hard day;
- you can play at work by minimizing or opening the game tab at the right time.
- attention, the game is very addictive!

instructions:
Computer controls:
The "A" and "D" keys or the "Left" and "Right" arrows - for movement;
The keys "W" or "SPACE" or Up Arrow - to jump;
"S" or Down Arrow keys - to jump off a ledge or fall through a thin object;
The "SHIFT" key - to switch to Running;

Controls on your phone (smartphone):
Buttons on the screen, more specifically:
Arrows "Left" and "Right" - for movement, pressing the edge of the button (highlighted in color) will transition to Running;
Up arrow - for jumping;
Down Arrow - to climb off a ledge or fall through a thin object;

IMPORTANT:
1. The character can grab the edges of obstacles with his hand.
2. You can not only climb down from the ledge, but also jump up using a jump.

Everyone will be able to understand the game:
- press your finger/cursor to shoot;
- move your finger/cursor around the screen to move;
- dodge falling balls;
- collect coins and prizes to get a bonus.
- Pump up your cannon: the left improvement button will add shooting speed, the right button will increase the number of shells per shot.

Now you're ready for battle, get in the game!

— Choose your favorite weapon;
— Choose awesome skin for it;
— Hit play button;
— Shoot at the right moment to keep moving up!
— Pick up useful bonuses (ammo and boosters)!
— Get as high as you can!
— Collect coins to unlock new guns and skins!
